    "message": "Add sample repro screen for Issue #530 (iOS NavigationBar transition glitch)\n\nAdds an 'Issue #530 Repro' entry under the Navigation category that mirrors the reporter's Navigation 3 setup: a NavDisplay hosting a tabs route with AdaptiveNavigationBar and a detail route with no bottom bar. Brings in jetbrains-navigation3-ui and lifecycle-viewmodel-navigation3 as sample-only dependencies.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>",
